{"828190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "M.E.C.H.A.: Memory Erasure Control of Hover Attractor", "steam_appid": 828190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828190/extras/ba1626e51d27f1a761ca4e2751c6e2d9.poster.avif?t=1785996720\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828190/extras/ba1626e51d27f1a761ca4e2751c6e2d9.webm?t=1785996720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828190/extras/ba1626e51d27f1a761ca4e2751c6e2d9.mp4?t=1785996720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This place <strong>scares</strong> me. Just when I think I've settled in, it <strong>changes</strong>. I <span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>don't</strong></span> want to go out. It hurts... But I'm <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">happy</span></strong> tired of being here. Maybe I should go out for just a second? Just for a second... I want to see something other than my <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">personality</span></strong> room...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong> - Combining a <u>dark dystopian atmosphere</u> with a <u>sweet story</u>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Сolourful Story</strong> - Experience a <u>vivid</u> and <u>emotional story</u> about <u>love</u>, <u>death</u>, <u>androids</u>, and <u>the legacy after death</u>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Date &amp; Fight</strong> - Experience the <u>gameplay mix</u> of <u>dating simulator</u> and <u>bloody action</u> with all the consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporation Tower</strong> - Encounter the <u>living embodiment</u> of the tower of a <u>mysterious corporation</u> that <u>rebuilds locations</u> at will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personality Attractor</strong> - <u>Meet Rika</u>, this is an <u>android girl</u> who can contain <u>different personalities</u> of other androids, and <u>switch between them</u> on the fly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828190/extras/603d33bb6a227b27a6641aad2b94ef9d.poster.avif?t=1785996720\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828190/extras/603d33bb6a227b27a6641aad2b94ef9d.webm?t=1785996720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828190/extras/603d33bb6a227b27a6641aad2b94ef9d.mp4?t=1785996720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828190/extras/ba1626e51d27f1a761ca4e2751c6e2d9.poster.avif?t=1785996720\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828190/extras/ba1626e51d27f1a761ca4e2751c6e2d9.webm?t=1785996720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828190/extras/ba1626e51d27f1a761ca4e2751c6e2d9.mp4?t=1785996720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This place <strong>scares</strong> me. Just when I think I've settled in, it <strong>changes</strong>. I <span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>don't</strong></span> want to go out. It hurts.